            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Questions from patients about pain conditions and analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from authors are presented to help educate patients and make them more effective self-advocates. The topics addressed in this issue are pain-related anxiety, its symptoms, and possible treatment approaches.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
